@MusicRecords_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

### Hent alle musikplader
GET {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/MusicRecords
Accept: application/json

### Hent musikplade med Id 1
GET {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/MusicRecords/1
Accept: application/json

### Opret musikplade
POST {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/MusicRecords
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Dark Side of the Moon",
  "artist": "Pink Floyd",
  "duration": 2580,
  "publicationYear": 1973
}

### Opdater musikplade med Id 1
PUT {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/MusicRecords/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Abbey Road (Remastered)",
  "artist": "The Beatles",
  "duration": 2847,
  "publicationYear": 1969
}

### Slet musikplade med Id 3
DELETE {{MusicRecords_HostAddress}}/api/MusicRecords/3
